2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	-
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- We are not a general purpose chat platform, but a topical
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- network intent on providing the open source and free
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- software communities a means to cooperate and communicate.
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- As such, illegal and off-topic activity, such as warez
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- trading, may result in being barred from access.
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	-
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- The Open and Free Technology Community was founded at the
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- end of 2001 by a group of experienced members of the Open
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- Source and Free Software communities; it is aimed at
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- providing these communities with better communication,
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- development, and support infrastructure. Our goal is to
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- provide stable services to members of the community in any
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- part of the world, while listening closely to their needs
2012-09-30 19:30:55	--	- and desires.
